Creates a shroud of darkness over a radius 3 area that lasts [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.  The shroud causes [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage each turn, reduces light radius by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], and darkness resistance by [22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of those within.
